<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="uk">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Castacraftowe — Живе крафтове пиво | Poznań</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Castacraftowe — власна броварня і бар у Познані. Живе нефільтроване пиво з українською душею. Jasne, Porter, Pszeniczne, Blanche, IPA. Półwiejska 6." />
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#0c1420" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Oswald:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Source+Sans+3:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #0c1420;
      --bg2: #111b2a;
      --card: #162033;
      --gold: #c9a227;
      --gold2: #e0b93d;
      --cream: #f0e9d8;
      --text: #d8d2c4;
      --muted: #9a9385;
      --border: rgba(201, 162, 39, 0.18);
    }
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body {
      font-family: 'Source Sans 3', system-ui, sans-serif;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      line-height: 1.65;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }
    h1, h2, h3, .logo, .tagline {
      font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    }

    /* NAV */
    nav {
      position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 1000;
      display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
      padding: 1rem 6%;
      background: rgba(12, 20, 32, 0.92);
      backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
    }
    nav.scrolled {
      padding: 0.7rem 6%;
      border-bottom-color: var(--border);
      background: rgba(12, 20, 32, 0.97);
    }
    .logo {
      font-size: 1.45rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--gold);
      text-decoration: none; letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    }
    .logo span { color: var(--cream); font-weight: 400; }
    .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 2rem; list-style: none; align-items: center; }
    .nav-links a {
      color: var(--text); text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.88rem;
      font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase;
      transition: color 0.2s; position: relative;
    }
    .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--gold); }
    .nav-btn {
      background: var(--gold); color: #0c1420 !important;
      padding: 0.5rem 1.2rem; font-weight: 600;
    }
    .nav-btn:hover { background: var(--gold2); color: #0c1420 !important; }
    .burger {
      display: none; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px;
      background: none; border: none; cursor: pointer; z-index: 1001;
    }
    .burger span {
      width: 24px; height: 2px; background: var(--gold);
      transition: 0.3s;
    }
    .burger.open span:nth-child(1) { transform: rotate(45deg) translate(5px, 5px); }
    .burger.open span:nth-child(2) { opacity: 0; }
    .burger.open span:nth-child(3) { transform: rotate(-45deg) translate(5px, -5px); }

    /* HERO */
    .hero {
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center;
      align-items: center; text-align: center;
      padding: 8rem 6% 5rem;
      position: relative;
      background:
        radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 60% at 50% 20%, rgba(201, 162, 39, 0.1) 0%, transparent 55%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, #0c1420 0%, #0f1a2a 100%);
    }
    .hero-badge {
      font-size: 0.75rem; letter-spacing: 0.28em; text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--gold); border: 1px solid rgba(201, 162, 39, 0.4);
      padding: 0.45rem 1.3rem; margin-bottom: 2rem;
      animation: fadeUp 0.8s ease both;
    }
    .hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2.9rem, 7.5vw, 5.4rem);
      line-height: 1.05; color: var(--cream); margin-bottom: 0.7rem;
      font-weight: 700; animation: fadeUp 0.8s 0.1s ease both;
    }
    .hero h1 span { color: var(--gold); }
    .tagline {
      font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 2.4vw, 1.4rem);
      color: var(--gold); font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.14em;
      margin-bottom: 1.6rem; animation: fadeUp 0.8s 0.2s ease both;
    }
    .hero-desc {
      max-width: 540px; font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--muted);
      margin-bottom: 2.4rem; font-weight: 300;
      animation: fadeUp 0.8s 0.3s ease both;
    }
    .hero-actions {
      display: flex; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center;
      animation: fadeUp 0.8s 0.4s ease both;
    }
    .btn {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      padding: 0.95rem 2rem; font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.92rem;
      text-decoration: none; letter-spacing: 0.07em; text-transform: uppercase;
      transition: all 0.25s; border: none; cursor: pointer;
    }
    .btn-gold { background: var(--gold); color: #0c1420; }
    .btn-gold:hover { background: var(--gold2); transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(201,162,39,0.25); }
    .btn-outline {
      background: transparent; color: var(--gold);
      border: 1.5px solid var(--gold);
    }
    .btn-outline:hover { background: rgba(201, 162, 39, 0.12); }

    .hero-stats {
      display: flex; gap: 3.5rem; margin-top: 4.5rem;
      padding-top: 2.2rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      animation: fadeUp 0.8s 0.5s ease both;
    }
    .stat strong {
      display: block; font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif;
      font-size: 2.2rem; color: var(--gold); font-weight: 600;
    }
    .stat span { font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--muted); letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-transform: uppercase; }

    @keyframes fadeUp {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(24px); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }

    /* REVEAL */
    .reveal {
      opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px);
      transition: opacity 0.7s ease, transform 0.7s ease;
    }
    .reveal.visible { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }

    section { padding: 5.5rem 6%; }
    .section-head { text-align: center; max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto 3.2rem; }
    .section-head .eyebrow {
      font-size: 0.72rem; letter-spacing: 0.24em; text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--gold); margin-bottom: 0.7rem;
    }
    .section-head h2 {
      font-size: clamp(1.85rem, 4vw, 2.6rem); color: var(--cream);
      margin-bottom: 0.9rem; font-weight: 600;
    }
    .section-head p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 1.05rem; }

    /* ABOUT */
    .about { background: var(--bg2); }
    .about-grid {
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 0.85fr; gap: 4rem;
      max-width: 1140px; margin: 0 auto; align-items: center;
    }
    .about-text h3 {
      font-size: 1.45rem; color: var(--gold); margin-bottom: 1.1rem; font-weight: 600;
    }
    .about-text p { color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 1.1rem; font-size: 1.05rem; }
    .about-points {
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1rem; margin-top: 1.8rem;
    }
    .point {
      background: var(--card); padding: 1.2rem 1.3rem;
      border-left: 3px solid var(--gold);
      transition: transform 0.25s;
    }
    .point:hover { transform: translateX(4px); }
    .point strong { display: block; color: var(--cream); margin-bottom: 0.25rem; font-size: 0.95rem; }
    .point span { font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--muted); }

    .hours-card {
      background: var(--card); padding: 2rem; border: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .hours-card h4 {
      font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif; color: var(--gold);
      font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 1.2rem; letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    }
    .hours-list { list-style: none; }
    .hours-list li {
      display: flex; justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 0.55rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }
    .hours-list li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .hours-list .day { color: var(--muted); }
    .hours-list .time { color: var(--cream); font-weight: 500; }

    /* BEERS */
    .beer-grid {
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(260px, 1fr));
      gap: 1.5rem; max-width: 1140px; margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .beer-card {
      background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--border);
      transition: border-color 0.3s, transform 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;
    }
    .beer-card:hover {
      border-color: rgba(201, 162, 39, 0.45);
      transform: translateY(-6px);
      box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
    }
    .beer-top {
      padding: 1.4rem 1.4rem 1rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .beer-top h3 {
      font-size: 1.3rem; color: var(--cream); margin-bottom: 0.3rem; font-weight: 600;
    }
    .beer-meta { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--gold); letter-spacing: 0.04em; }
    .beer-body { padding: 1.1rem 1.4rem 1.4rem; }
    .beer-body p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 0.9rem; }
    .tags { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.4rem; }
    .tag {
      font-size: 0.7rem; padding: 0.22rem 0.65rem;
      background: rgba(201, 162, 39, 0.12); color: var(--gold2);
      letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    /* SNACKS */
    .snacks { background: var(--bg2); }
    .snacks-grid {
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(200px, 1fr));
      gap: 1.3rem; max-width: 960px; margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .snack {
      background: var(--card); padding: 1.7rem 1.2rem; text-align: center;
      border: 1px solid var(--border); transition: border-color 0.25s, transform 0.25s;
    }
    .snack:hover { border-color: rgba(201, 162, 39, 0.4); transform: translateY(-4px); }
    .snack-icon { font-size: 2.1rem; margin-bottom: 0.7rem; }
    .snack h4 { color: var(--cream); font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 0.3rem; font-weight: 600; }
    .snack p { font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--muted); }

    /* REVIEWS */
    .reviews-grid {
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(290px, 1fr));
      gap: 1.5rem; max-width: 1140px; margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .review {
      background: var(--card); padding: 1.7rem; border: 1px solid var(--border);
      position: relative; transition: border-color 0.25s;
    }
    .review:hover { border-color: rgba(201, 162, 39, 0.35); }
    .review::before {
      content: '"'; position: absolute; top: 0.5rem; left: 1rem;
      font-size: 3.5rem; font-family: Georgia, serif;
      color: rgba(201, 162, 39, 0.15); line-height: 1;
    }
    .stars { color: var(--gold); letter-spacing: 2px; margin-bottom: 0.9rem; font-size: 0.9rem; }
    .review p { color: var(--text); font-size: 0.98rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; position: relative; z-index: 1; }
    .author { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--muted); }
    .author strong { color: var(--gold2); }

    .analysis {
      max-width: 900px; margin: 3.2rem auto 0;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(201, 162, 39, 0.07), rgba(22, 32, 51, 0.85));
      border: 1px solid rgba(201, 162, 39, 0.28); padding: 2rem 2.2rem;
    }
    .analysis h3 {
      font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif; color: var(--gold);
      font-size: 1.15rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    }
    .analysis ul {
      list-style: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 0.7rem;
    }
    .analysis li {
      color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.95rem; padding-left: 1.3rem; position: relative;
    }
    .analysis li::before { content: '▸'; position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--gold); }

    /* GALLERY */
    .gallery-grid {
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 1rem;
      max-width: 1140px; margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .gallery-item {
      aspect-ratio: 1; background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--border);
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem; text-align: center;
      transition: border-color 0.25s, transform 0.25s;
      overflow: hidden; position: relative;
    }
    .gallery-item:hover { border-color: var(--gold); transform: scale(1.02); }
    .gallery-item img {
      width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover;
    }

    /* LOCATION */
    .location { background: var(--bg2); }
    .loc-grid {
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 3rem;
      max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; align-items: start;
    }
    .loc-info h3 {
      font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif; color: var(--gold);
      font-size: 1.3rem; margin-bottom: 1.4rem; letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    }
    .info-row { display: flex; gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
    .info-icon {
      width: 40px; height: 40px; background: rgba(201, 162, 39, 0.12);
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      color: var(--gold); flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 1.05rem;
    }
    .info-text strong { display: block; color: var(--cream); margin-bottom: 0.15rem; }
    .info-text span, .info-text a {
      color: var(--muted); text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.95rem;
    }
    .info-text a:hover { color: var(--gold); }
    .map-wrap {
      height: 360px; border: 1px solid var(--border); overflow: hidden;
    }
    .map-wrap iframe { width: 100%; height: 100%; border: 0; filter: grayscale(0.2) contrast(1.05); }

    /* CONTACT FORM */
    .contact-form {
      max-width: 560px; margin: 3rem auto 0;
      background: var(--card); padding: 2rem; border: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .contact-form h3 {
      font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif; color: var(--gold);
      margin-bottom: 1.3rem; font-size: 1.15rem; letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    }
    .form-group { margin-bottom: 1.1rem; }
    .form-group label {
      display: block; font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--muted);
      margin-bottom: 0.35rem; letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    }
    .form-group input, .form-group textarea {
      width: 100%; padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
      background: var(--bg); border: 1px solid var(--border);
      color: var(--cream); font-family: inherit; font-size: 0.95rem;
      outline: none; transition: border-color 0.2s;
    }
    .form-group input:focus, .form-group textarea:focus {
      border-color: var(--gold);
    }
    .form-group textarea { min-height: 110px; resize: vertical; }

    /* CTA */
    .cta {
      text-align: center; padding: 5.5rem 6%;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg) 0%, #0a111c 100%);
    }
    .cta h2 {
      font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 3.5vw, 2.4rem); color: var(--cream);
      margin-bottom: 0.9rem;
    }
    .cta p { color: var(--muted); max-width: 480px; margin: 0 auto 2rem; }

    /* FOOTER */
    footer {
      background: #080e18; padding: 2.5rem 6% 1.8rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .footer-inner {
      max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto;
      display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1.2rem;
    }
    .footer-logo {
      font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif; font-size: 1.2rem;
      color: var(--gold); letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    }
    .footer-links { display: flex; gap: 1.6rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .footer-links a {
      color: var(--muted); text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.85rem;
      text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    }
    .footer-links a:hover { color: var(--gold); }
    .footer-copy {
      width: 100%; text-align: center; margin-top: 1.8rem; padding-top: 1.3rem;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
      font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--muted);
    }

    /* MOBILE */
    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .about-grid, .loc-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .about-points { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .analysis ul { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .gallery-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
      .hero-stats { gap: 2rem; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; }
      .nav-links {
        display: none; position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
        background: rgba(12, 20, 32, 0.98); flex-direction: column;
        justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 1.8rem;
        z-index: 999;
      }
      .nav-links.open { display: flex; }
      .nav-links a { font-size: 1.2rem; }
      .burger { display: flex; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      section { padding: 4rem 5%; }
      .hero-stats { flex-direction: column; gap: 1.1rem; }
      .gallery-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 0.7rem; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<nav id="nav">
  <a href="#" class="logo">CASTA<span>CRAFTOWE</span></a>
  <ul class="nav-links" id="navLinks">
    <li><a href="#about">Про нас</a></li>
    <li><a href="#beers">Пиво</a></li>
    <li><a href="#snacks">Перекуси</a></li>
    <li><a href="#reviews">Відгуки</a></li>
    <li><a href="#gallery">Галерея</a></li>
    <li><a href="#location">Контакти</a></li>
    <li><a href="#location" class="nav-btn">Завітай</a></li>
  </ul>
  <button class="burger" id="burger" aria-label="Меню">
    <span></span><span></span><span></span>
  </button>
</nav>

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-badge">Власна броварня • Бар у центрі Познані</div>
  <h1>Живе пиво<br><span>з характером</span></h1>
  <p class="tagline">No crap on tap. Тільки своє.</p>
  <p class="hero-desc">
    Нефільтроване, непастеризоване, зварене нами в Мосіні. 
    Українська душа + європейські традиції. 
    Приходь на Półwiejska 6.
  </p>
  <div class="hero-actions">
    <a href="#beers" class="btn btn-gold">Наше пиво</a>
    <a href="#location" class="btn btn-outline">Як нас знайти</a>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-stats">
    <div class="stat"><strong>4.6</strong><span>Google</span></div>
    <div class="stat"><strong>9+</strong><span>сортів</span></div>
    <div class="stat"><strong>2024</strong><span>рік заснування</span></div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ABOUT -->
<section class="about" id="about">
  <div class="section-head reveal">
    <div class="eyebrow">Хто ми</div>
    <h2>Створено пасіонатами<br>для пасіонатів</h2>
    <p>Броварня в Мосіні + бар у самому серці Старого Міста</p>
  </div>
  <div class="about-grid">
    <div class="about-text reveal">
      <h3>Пиво, яке ще живе</h3>
      <p>
        Ми не фільтруємо і не пастеризуємо. Дріжджі продовжують працювати 
        навіть після розливу. Тому в келиху — максимум смаку і аромату.
      </p>
      <p>
        Castacraftowe — це український характер у поєднанні з класичними 
        європейськими стилями. Варимо самі. Наливаємо самі.
      </p>
      <div class="about-points">
        <div class="point"><strong>Нефільтроване</strong><span>Живий смак</span></div>
        <div class="point"><strong>Свіже</strong><span>Зазвичай &lt; 30 днів</span></div>
        <div class="point"><strong>Власне</strong><span>Варимо в Мосіні</span></div>
        <div class="point"><strong>З крана</strong><span>Найкращий формат</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hours-card reveal">
      <h4>Години роботи</h4>
      <ul class="hours-list">
        <li><span class="day">Пн – Чт</span><span class="time">14:00 – 22:00</span></li>
        <li><span class="day">П’ятниця</span><span class="time">12:00 – 00:00</span></li>
        <li><span class="day">Субота</span><span class="time">12:00 – 02:00</span></li>
        <li><span class="day">Неділя</span><span class="time">14:00 – 22:00</span></li>
      </ul>
      <p style="margin-top: 1.4rem; font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--muted);">
        Бар: <strong style="color: var(--cream);">Półwiejska 6, Poznań</strong>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- BEERS -->
<section id="beers">
  <div class="section-head reveal">
    <div class="eyebrow">Меню</div>
    <h2>Що наливаємо</h2>
    <p>Класика і авторські рецепти. Усе зварено нами.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="beer-grid">
    <div class="beer-card reveal">
      <div class="beer-top"><h3>Jasne</h3><div class="beer-meta">4.5% · Lager</div></div>
      <div class="beer-body">
        <p>Легке, чисте, освіжаюче. Ідеальне «щоденне» пиво.</p>
